      "content": "I follow you on the momentum transfer part. To make sure my students get it, could you use a concrete analogy to illustrate how this simultaneous exchange of pressure and momentum works? Like, how can one single movement of the wing result in both a pressure drop and a downward deflection at the same time?",
      "source": "evaluator"
